{"type":"message","id":"24e4d728","parentId":"d9b155e9","timestamp":"2026-04-22T22:00:21.539Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_c1afb614946a49b29f4a3a9b","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# 2026-04-23 - Daily Memory\n\n## Heartbeat Findings\n\n### Persistent Cron Issues\n- **daily-github-backup:** HTTP 403 error since 2026-04-14 04:00 KST (consecutive errors: 2). Lfantasial lacks write permission to NousResearch/hermes-agent.git. Action: Update remote to fork or obtain write permission.\n- **periodic-memory-maintenance:** Telegram recipient @heartbeat could not be resolved (consecutive errors: 3). Memory distillation automation disrupted. Action: Update Telegram recipient configuration.\n\n### Security Posture\n- **Security audit regression:** Critical issues increased from 2-3 (Apr 10-17) to 6 (Apr 19). Critical findings: Open groups with elevated tools, runtime/filesystem exposure in Telegram, Telegram groupPolicy=open without allowlist. Action: Immediate security configuration required.\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1776895221530}}
